    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90's Poland.  Potholed roads. 15% unemployment rate. Eurodance music.<br><br>And you, a simple country boy who loves to sit in the garage after nights. <br> <br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> buy OHV car, get rid of rust and dirt, paint and tune it, join &quot;Automobilklub&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">build your buggy, cut and weld pipes in any shape you want and\u00a0\u00a0take part in the races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> paint your daily vehicle &quot;Odra&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deliver coal in\u00a0 SMAR truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> build up your muscles on basement gym,  take part in weight lifting contest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> eat sausage and &quot;oscypki&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">make\u00a0pickled cucumbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">rob\u00a0allotment gardens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cut off\u00a0catalytic converter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">buy clothes on street market </p></li></ul>",
